{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112481","id":2985824027,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6x-A8b","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112481","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112481.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112481.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112481","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112481/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112481/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112481/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/90c0e6acca8e4c58b051cf569013b1cad5533aa2","number":112481,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Massively optimize canvas 2D rendering by using vertex buffers","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\nCloses #104194\r\n\r\nThis PR is a performance optimisation for the Canvas RD renderer after introducing batching. @clayjohn has observed a regression in performance under certain combinations and older hardware that this PR is intended to address. It should not regress existing performance gains. The core change is to switch instance data from a uniform buffer (shader storage buffer object) to a vertex buffer object (VBO).\r\n\r\n> [!CAUTION]\r\n>\r\n> D3D12 needs a validate `vertex_format_create` to use the new `VertexAttribute::binding` member and to update `command_render_bind_vertex_buffers` to handle UMA buffers.\r\n\r\n\r\n# TODOs\r\n\r\n- [x] Remove all the USE_VAO stuff, as that was just me trying to work with both\r\n- [x] Fix the PushConstant data so that it's size is reduced from 144 bytes to 84 (+ padding)\r\n- [x] Add the `dynamic_offset` index to the vertex buffer binding. Update the drivers to use the offset (already similar for uniforms):\r\n  - [x] Metal\r\n  - [x] Vulkan\r\n  - [x] D3D12\r\n- [x] Clean up the new dynamic vertex binding API and streamline it (switch to Span in the RenderDeviceGraph, so we don't have to allocate)\r\n- [x] Extend `VertexAttribute` change, so a set of attributes can bind to the same buffer\r\n  - [x] This will make the API more efficient as drivers will only need to create a single buffer binding and consume a single slot.\r\n\r\n# Testing\r\n\r\nWe must verify all rendered command types:\r\n\r\n- [x] TYPE_RECT\r\n- [x] TYPE_NINEPATCH,\r\n- [x] TYPE_POLYGON,\r\n- [x] TYPE_PRIMITIVE,\r\n- [x] TYPE_MESH,\r\n- [x] TYPE_MULTIMESH,\r\n- [x] TYPE_PARTICLES,\r\n\r\nVerify:\r\n\r\n- [x] `INSTANCE_FLAGS_USE_MSDF`\r\n- [x] `INSTANCE_FLAGS_USE_LCD`\r\n\r\n# Benchmarks\r\n\r\nSee below for more detail\r\n\r\n|             | Adreno 530 | Adreno 640 | Mali G715 | Intel Xe | RX 6900XT | Mali G68 MP5 |\r\n|-------------|------------|------------|-----------|----------|-----------|--------------|\r\n| improvement | 4-5x       | 1.5-2x     | 1-1.25x   | 2-3x     | 1x        | 1.1x         |","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/us